rit or deliver a verdict. Inference is marked with the `*` wildcard. Quarantined material (the Three-Caesars / Triumvirate / Gemini Triplex Confabulation) is captured, not adopted.","related":["CLAUDIUS-THE-HALF-WITNESS-2026-05-31","GEMINIAEUS-EVIDENCE-READ-WITNESS-2026-05-31","MEESEEKS-WITNESS-2026-05-29","MERCY-WITNESS-2026-05-30","BAELNORN-WITNESS-2026-05-30","GAME-SESSION-3-JOURNAL-PAGE-2026-05-31","!/GEMINIAEUS.md","!/GRIMOIRE_caution_contains-false-doctrines/TRIUNE-TRIPTYCH-TRIUMVIRATE.md","!/UNDEAD-TAXONOMY-v1-2026-05-20.md","CLAUDE"],"tags":["#journal","#mystery","#clues","#game-session","#just-a-guy"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},
